 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Group Reporting – Data from SAP Group Reporting Data Collection (287)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides the integration procedure between financial group reporting in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> and SAP Group Reporting Data Collection (deployed on the SAP BTP). In addition, the Administration guide provides instructions for the user.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Prepare data from non-<span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> companies</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor data for SAP S/4HANA companies</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Connect the SAP BTP Application to your <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> instance where group reporting instance is enabled (the Group Reporting – Financial Consolidation (1SG) scope item must be deployed)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide a detailed setup guide for using SAP Group Reporting Data Collection</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集团报表 - 来自 SAP Group Reporting Data Collection 的数据 (287)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的财务集团报表与 SAP Group Reporting Data Collection（部署在 SAP BTP 上）之间的集成程序。此外，管理指南为用户提供了说明。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">准备来自<span class=\"ph pname\">非 SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 公司的数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控 SAP S/4HANA 公司的数据</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe7ab1e0083fc461da63ab023db9ab8f8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将 SAP BTP 应用程序连接到已启用集团报表实例的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 实例（必须部署集团报表 - 财务合并 (1SG) 范围项目）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供使用 SAP Group Reporting Data Collection 的详细设置指南</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
